{"ID":"20250917111242-js8oaxu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250917111242-js8oaxu","title":"UPL5-1——计时判断代码执行效率","type":"doc","updated":"20250917125221"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917120458-6ar9zsk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250917120458-6ar9zsk","updated":"20250917125221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250917120505-vx63hw3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250917120505-vx63hw3","updated":"20250917125221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Time.realtimeSinceStartup\t\t\t\t// 得到Unity程序从启动以来的时间\nStopwatch\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 用于高精度计时的工具类，可以精确地测量代码执行的时间\nStopwatch.StartNew()\t\t\t\t\t// 该方法会返回一个Stopwatch对象，并开始计时\nstopwatch.Stop()\t\t\t\t\t\t// 该方法通过计时对象调用，将停止计时\nstopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds\t\t\t// 通过计时对象调用，获取耗时时间（毫秒），返回类型为 long，不使用与小于 1ms 的时间获取\nstopwatch.Elapsed.TotalMilliseconds\t\t// 该成员通过计时对象调用，获取耗时时间（毫秒），返回类型为 double，可以精确到微秒级\nstopwatch.Restart()\t\t\t\t\t\t// 清零重启计时\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250917111242-ad33s1r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250917111242-ad33s1r","updated":"20250917111630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要计时判断代码执行效率"}]},{"ID":"20250917111559-dip1p8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111559-dip1p8s","updated":"20250917111605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏开发中性能资源有限，如果某些代码段耗时过长，会导致帧率下降、卡顿或掉帧，从而导致玩家体验变差\n通过计时我们可以更“细颗粒度”找出是哪段代码导致帧率下降"}]},{"ID":"20250917111559-d8bdlg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111559-d8bdlg0","updated":"20250917111612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虽然 Profiler 可以帮助我们排查耗时的元凶，但是手动实现代码计时依然可以给我们带来以下好处"}]},{"ID":"20250917111614-317dhpl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111614-317dhpl","updated":"20250917111629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111618-qea6gt9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111618-qea6gt9","updated":"20250917111629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111618-wntit46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111618-wntit46","updated":"20250917111629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 在正式发布版中一般不包含，而手动计时代码可以在正式版本中用于日志上报、自动分析等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917111618-zd1a6cc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111618-zd1a6cc","updated":"20250917111628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111618-ivwn7mf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111618-ivwn7mf","updated":"20250917111628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 不太适合精细比较同一段代码在不同算法下的微秒级表现，而手动计时代码可以让我们针对性的“细颗粒度”的进行比较"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917111618-cye82i6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111618-cye82i6","updated":"20250917111628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111618-hinmpjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111618-hinmpjg","updated":"20250917111628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 不太适合做批量性能测试、基准对比，而手动计算可以把一个算法跑指定次数，计算平均耗时、最大耗时等等"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250917111616-fnzhmxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111616-fnzhmxj","updated":"20250917111616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250917111630-edz9vij","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250917111630-edz9vij","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"计时判断代码执行效率的基本原理"}]},{"ID":"20250917111643-lym6aay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111643-lym6aay","updated":"20250917111646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：记录一段代码执行前后的时间差，从而估算它的运行耗时\n说人话：耗时 = 结束时间 - 开始时间"}]},{"ID":"20250917111643-o1p1ai8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111643-o1p1ai8","updated":"20250917111747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测试建议："}]},{"ID":"20250917111648-i0epy0y","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-i0epy0y","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111648-zf51nfg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-zf51nfg","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111648-hdzud7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-hdzud7u","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多次执行计算 求平均值"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917111648-qnadin6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-qnadin6","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111648-5sxr079","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-5sxr079","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要在初始化中测试，待消耗稳定后，通过按键启用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917111648-y3czjpi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-y3czjpi","updated":"20250917111648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917111648-krqnpkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111648-krqnpkq","updated":"20250917111700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要在测试中使用 Unity 的控制台打印相关 API，应在完成测试后再输出 或 直接记录数据"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250917111701-itd99p7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250917111701-itd99p7","name":"Time.realtimeSinceStartup","updated":"20250917120443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 Unity 的 Time 类计时（精度低）"}]},{"ID":"20250917111840-em5rpts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917111840-em5rpts","updated":"20250917114539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Time"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 类中游戏启动以来的时间进行计算\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Time.realtimeSinceStartup"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 得到的时间单位是秒，带小数，是毫秒级的，精度适中（不受 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230708212115-p37ztsr","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Time.timeScale"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 缩放影响）"}]},{"ID":"20250917111915-1ypab14","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250917111915-1ypab14","updated":"20250917112053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float startTime = Time.realtimeSinceStartup;\n//执行一段逻辑代码\nDebug.Log(\"12312312\");\n\nfloat spendTime = (Time.realtimeSinceStartup - startTime) * 1000f;\nDebug.Log($\"Debug打印耗时: {spendTime} ms\");\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250917112705-x8krxqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917112705-x8krxqx","updated":"20250917112705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250917112705-th5261i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917112720-y8hyri4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250917112720-y8hyri4","updated":"20250917120443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 机制封装一个计时类"}]},{"ID":"20250917112856-qcn21bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917112856-qcn21bd","updated":"20250917114513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20231101183353-yqch9e2","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"using"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 语句块，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"using"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 语句块包裹的对象使用完后会调用销毁逻辑（执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispose"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数），可简化操作逻辑"}]},{"ID":"20250917114029-c07afe7","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250917114029-c07afe7","updated":"20250917120443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using System;\nusing UnityEngine;\n\npublic class UnityTimer : IDisposable\n{\n    private string _name;       // 计时任务的名字\n    private uint _num;          // 计时任务的执行次数\n    private float _startTime;   // 计时开始时间\n\n\n    public UnityTimer(string name, uint num)\n    {\n        _name = name;\n        if (num == 0)\n            num = 1;\n        _num = num;\n        _startTime = Time.realtimeSinceStartup;\n    }\n\n    public void Dispose()\n    {\n        float spendTime = (Time.realtimeSinceStartup - _startTime) * 1000f;\n        DebugUtil.Log($\"{_name} 计时结束，共耗时{spendTime}ms，一共测试{_num}次，每次耗时{spendTime / _num}ms\");\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250917114034-iybnu5d","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250917114034-iybnu5d","updated":"20250917114215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using (new UnityTimer(\"Debug耗时测试\", 10000))\n{\n    //执行一段逻辑代码\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 10000; i++)\n    {\n        Debug.Log(\"12312312\");\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250917114046-jvmeblz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114046-jvmeblz","updated":"20250917114243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250917114243-btio2q5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917114628-byhdn07","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250917114628-byhdn07","name":"Stopwatch","updated":"20250917125214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 Stopwatch 类"}]},{"ID":"20250917114639-l49zkmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114639-l49zkmr","updated":"20250917114702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Stopwatch"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 类是 C# 中提供的一个用于高精度计时的工具类，它可以精确地测量代码执行的时间，常用于性能分析和调试\n所属命名空间："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"System.Diagnostics"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（诊断）"}]},{"ID":"20250917114704-s73ul7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114704-s73ul7s","updated":"20250917114704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该类提供毫秒甚至微妙级别的计时精度"}]},{"ID":"20250917114706-mugc5ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114706-mugc5ca","updated":"20250917114706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常用API："}]},{"ID":"20250917114710-wghzekt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114710-wghzekt","updated":"20250917125214"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114715-5ecjdwc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-5ecjdwc","updated":"20250917114715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114715-7du4yp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-7du4yp6","updated":"20250917114731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用类中提供的静态方法开启一个计时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Stopwatch.StartNew()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917114727-ayif01z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114727-ayif01z","updated":"20250917114727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该方法会返回一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Stopwatch"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 对象，并开始计时"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917114715-i6cbr82","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-i6cbr82","updated":"20250917114715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114715-c9uhom2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-c9uhom2","updated":"20250917114813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"停止计时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"stopwatch.Stop()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917114736-62odlc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114736-62odlc8","updated":"20250917114736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该方法通过计时对象调用，将停止计时"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917114715-6gppxn0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-6gppxn0","updated":"20250917125214"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114715-ijypk83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-ijypk83","updated":"20250917114804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"获取计时"}]},{"ID":"20250917114806-03uzfks","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114806-03uzfks","updated":"20250917125214"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114808-t7v64tr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114808-t7v64tr","updated":"20250917114808"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114808-2xncfka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114808-2xncfka","updated":"20250917114817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"stopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917114822-3vk8vj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114822-3vk8vj5","updated":"20250917114837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该成员通过计时对象调用，获取耗时时间（毫秒）\n返回类型为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"long"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，不使用与小于 1ms 的时间获取"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917114825-dq1squv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114825-dq1squv","updated":"20250917125214"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114825-0tluhy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114825-0tluhy2","updated":"20250917114908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"stopwatch.Elapsed.TotalMilliseconds"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917114831-arssswk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114831-arssswk","updated":"20250917125214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该成员通过计时对象调用，获取耗时时间（毫秒）\n返回类型为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"double"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，可以精确到微秒级"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250917114715-y4ls0b3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-y4ls0b3","updated":"20250917114715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917114715-ekq4bon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114715-ekq4bon","updated":"20250917114854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重启计时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"stopwatch.Restart()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917114854-b8q115j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917114854-b8q115j","updated":"20250917114854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该方法通过计时对象调用，会清零重启计时"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250917120207-76nlmig","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250917120207-76nlmig","updated":"20250917120421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 机制封装一个计时类"}]},{"ID":"20250917120149-2gclhus","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250917120149-2gclhus","updated":"20250917120421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using System;\nusing System.Diagnostics;\n\npublic class CodeTimer : IDisposable\n{\n    private string _name;       // 计时任务的名字\n    private uint _num;          // 计时任务的执行次数\n    private Stopwatch _watch;   // 计时对象\n\n    public CodeTimer(string name, uint num)\n    {\n        _name = name;\n        if (num \u003c= 0)\n            num = 1;\n        _num = num;\n        _watch = Stopwatch.StartNew();\n    }\n\n    public void Dispose()\n    {\n        _watch.Stop();\n        double spendTime = _watch.Elapsed.TotalMilliseconds;\n        DebugUtil.Log($\"{_name} 计时结束，共耗时{spendTime}ms，一共测试{_num}次，每次耗时{spendTime / _num}ms\");\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250917120316-ce3u1yu","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250917120316-ce3u1yu","updated":"20250917120327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using (new CodeTimer(\"Debug耗时测试\", 10000))\n{\n    //执行一段逻辑代码\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 10000; i++)\n    {\n        Debug.Log(\"12312312\");\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250917120314-8vlidnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917120314-8vlidnc","updated":"20250917120314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250917120314-j3pby6n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250917120328-spn3ycr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917120328-spn3ycr","updated":"20250917120328"}}]}